     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div>[Apologies for cross-posting] <br></div><div><br></div><div>I hope everyone&#39;s summers are going well. <br></div><div><br></div><div>I&#39;m looking for a long-term (1-2 year) part-time collaborator to work on a geospatial &amp; sociodemographic analysis of utility-scale renewable energy facilities, particularly their implications for environmental justice communities. In particular, I&#39;m looking for someone with data science &amp; geospatial analysis skills who can write code that can get 29 state-level, and 2 national scale energy utility data sets (up to 10,000 entries each) to speak to each other, and then conduct geospatial analysis using US census information. I have 24 of these data sets already in hand and am in the process of compiling the remaining sets. The project is not yet funded, but if this sounds like something you&#39;d be excited to work on - let&#39;s talk!<br></div><div><br></div><div>Best,</div><div>Ingrid<br></div><br>-- <br><div dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gmail_signature\" data-smartmail=\"gmail_signature\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\">Ingrid Behrsin, <span>PhD, MSc<br>(</span><span><span><i><span><span>she/her/hers)</span></span></i></span></span></div><div dir=\"ltr\"><span><span><i><span><span></span></span></i></span></span>Provost&#39;s Postdoctoral Fellow</div><div dir=\"ltr\">Office of Public Scholarship and Engagement<span><span><span><span><span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div dir=\"ltr\">University of California, Davis</div><div dir=\"ltr\"><span><span><a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">iabe...@ucdavis.edu</a><br></span></span></div><div><span><span><a href=\"http://www.ingridbehrsin.net\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.ingridbehrsin.net&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792465806659000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0czoX2jYF1LHFVPenLgy8E\">www.ingridbehrsin.net</a><br></span></span></div><div><span><span><br></span></span></div><div><span><span><span style=\"color:rgb(68,68,68)\"><b><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span><span><span><span style=\"color:rgb(68,68,68)\"><b>** </b></span></span></span></span></span>Read my </b></span></span></span><span><span><span style=\"color:rgb(68,68,68)\"><b>most recent <a href=\"https://www.tandfonline.com/eprint/FrtbpzWbYCKjTufEmsK7/full?target=10.1080/24694452.2019.1569492\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://www.tandfonline.com/eprint/FrtbpzWbYCKjTufEmsK7/full?target%3D10.1080/24694452.2019.1569492&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792465806659000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1nx0YJOXROQo0T5UBojVSk\">critical renewabilities publication</a>, in <i>Annals of the American Association of Geographers</i>, on waste incineration as socio-ecological  fix in the EU.<br></b></span></span></span></div><div><span><span><span style=\"color:rgb(68,68,68)\"><b><br></b></span></span></span></div><div><span><span><span style=\"color:rgb(68,68,68)\"><b>** Recent <a href=\"https://www.euractiv.com/section/circular-economy/opinion/waste-incineration-is-waste-incineration-no-matter-the-classification/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://www.euractiv.com/section/circular-economy/opinion/waste-incineration-is-waste-incineration-no-matter-the-classification/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792465806659000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2g2cXrSBdMLXUD9iHNee9q\">op-ed</a> urging members of the European Parliament to reject proposals that incentivize waste incineration.</b></span><br></span></span></div><div><span><span><br></span></span></div><div><span><span><img src=\"https://ci6.googleusercontent.com/proxy/FPPPPndBdOeCUF4I3S8CItVYqAiuS6-8veclfrPRvCx1S2o_Frimh0r5ocFhDITEZpwaOeKN2FoAh5DrACAFBF_Wte9bgmvIV4JSf3uaI-KLxwMN2LFRXhG0SyOX8S3zwC-Y8y0s7rYPnqUTwITpt4gvBRytILw9SM_m1wGUlHo8Ln6HlJFjUTs8reKR5S6pJyVTXA8TmYwaXvF0jQ=s0-d-e1-ft#https://docs.google.com/uc?export=download&amp;id=1DRFfRSGb9ecSXXNNOFNv-ZgbH8G3vaXK&amp;revid=0B8LHWiKbR8GwWWZWYk5XcXl3aXkzQTdpWmg0cW5ac1cyU0o4PQ\"><br></span></span></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div>\r\n"
